<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs scarce - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs scarce - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following Thursdays sharp price decline and hot humid weather, barrows and gilts scarce.</p>
<p>Not well tested. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    Not well tested</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.25-0.50 lower; 500-650 lbs 1.50-2.00 higher.</p>
<p>Other weights not well established. Top 50.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs     46.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs     50.50</p>
</text>
